## User

The last element of a list, or the given default when the list is empty.

## Type

type
```agda
lastOr : ℕ → List ℕ → ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
lastOr zero    []       = zero
lastOr zero    (x ∷ xs) = x
lastOr (suc n) (x ∷ xs) = lastOr n xs
```

## agda

lastOr-++ : ∀ {A : Set} (xs ys : List A) → lastOr (length xs) (xs ++ ys) ≡ lastOr (length ys) xs
```

